#: .\templates\dashboard.html:67
msgid "<strong>WIP (Work In Progress)</strong><br> Nombre total de tickets actuellement en cours (statuts actifs).<br> Un WIP trop eleve augmente le multitache, l'attente et ralentit le flux."
msgstr "<strong>WIP (Work In Progress)</strong><br> Total number of tickets currently in progress (active statuses).<br> A WIP that is too high increases multitasking and waiting, and slows the flow."

#: .\templates\dashboard.html:72
msgid "<strong>Aging WIP &gt; 10 jours</strong><br> Nombre de tickets en cours depuis plus de 10 jours.<br> Un volume eleve indique un risque de blocage ou de dispersion du travail."
msgstr "<strong>Aging WIP &gt; 10 days</strong><br> Number of tickets in progress for more than 10 days.<br> A high count points to a risk of blockage or scattered work."

#: .\templates\dashboard.html:77
#, python-format
msgid "<strong>Cycle Time (P50)</strong><br>Temps median necessaire pour terminer un ticket a partir du premier statut <em>In Progress</em>.<br>Le P50 signifie que 50%% des tickets sont termines en moins de cette duree."
msgstr "<strong>Cycle Time (P50)</strong><br>Median time needed to finish a ticket from its first <em>In Progress</em> status.<br>P50 means that 50%% of tickets are finished in less than this time."

#: .\templates\dashboard.html:80
msgid "<strong>Lead Time (P50)</strong><br> Temps median entre la creation d'un ticket et sa finalisation.<br> Il reflete l'experience reelle du client."
msgstr "<strong>Lead Time (P50)</strong><br> Median time between a ticket's creation and its completion.<br> It reflects the customer's real experience."

#: .\templates\dashboard.html:85
msgid "<strong>Throughput (7 jours)</strong><br> Nombre de tickets termines au cours des 7 derniers jours.<br> Indicateur cle de capacite et de stabilite du flux."
msgstr "<strong>Throughput (7 days)</strong><br> Number of tickets finished over the last 7 days.<br> Key indicator of capacity and flow stability."

#: .\templates\dashboard.html:90
msgid "<strong>Flow efficiency</strong><br> Part du temps ou le ticket est <em>reellement travaille</em> (cycle time) par rapport au temps total entre creation et fin (lead time).<br> <strong>Bas</strong> : beaucoup d'attente. <strong>Haut</strong> : flux fluide."
msgstr "<strong>Flow efficiency</strong><br> Share of the time the ticket is <em>actually worked on</em> (cycle time) compared with the total time between creation and completion (lead time).<br> <strong>Low</strong>: a lot of waiting. <strong>High</strong>: smooth flow."

